<title>USA: TABLE - Rockshox Q1 results.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Rockshox Q1 results.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>ROCKSHOX, INC.</p>
<p>Financial Highlights</p>
<p>(in thousands)</p>
<p>Results of consolidated operations:</p>
<p>						Three Months Ended</p>
<p>				 Actual	   Actual  Pro Forma (a)</p>
<p>			   Jun 30, 1997  Jun 30, 1996  Jun 30, 1996</p>
