<p>     calculation		   14,048	   9,240    13,610</p>
<p>NOTE: (a) The pro forma statement of operations reflect certain adjustments related to the Company's initial public offering that occurred in September 1996. The adjustments relate to the elimination of interest and dividends to the holders of the company's debt and preferred stock that were repaid from the proceeds of the IPO and the reduction of certain operating expenses to reflect the termination of an incentive based bonus plan with the founders of the company. The tax impact of these pro forma adjustments has been calculated using an incremental tax rate of 40 percent.</p>
